     "3711122b-2ec1-4731-a385-afcda412ac44"], Cell[
    "Two distinct points determine one and only one line.", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"c367c5a2-a8a5-403a-94b5-ee1b76fd61e7"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
