     "4283b1f2-f3b2-43df-9c6f-514697a730f1"], Cell["\<\
Given points, a point can be laid off at a prescribed distance along the \
segment.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"08a0bae5-db4d-4c78-b964-afcd4106d451"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "89f58197-914d-4279-8a0e-524e2e16445b"], Cell[
